        -:    1:///////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
        -:    2:// Name:        wx/windowid.h
        -:    3:// Purpose:     wxWindowID class - a class for managing window ids
        -:    4:// Author:      Brian Vanderburg II
        -:    5:// Created:     2007-09-21
